  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/335280s.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 142px; height: 125px;\" /><br /><br />Volume does not remain constant throughout the process <math> <mrow>  <mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></math>. As <math><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>, temperature decreases initially as both <math> <mi>P</mi></math> and <math> <mi>V</mi></math> decreases. By area under curve, net work done is negative.",
